(6206965, 916704, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice rural scene with a great backdrop - but I suspect the film noise and relatively small size of the horses will go against you.<br/> <br/>As the horses are clearly the main visual focus it would have been nice to see them filling the screen with head held high and flowing manes rather than in the background.<br/> <br/>Good luck though.</td>', 'Nice rural scene with a great backdrop - but I suspect the film noise and relatively small size of the horses will go against you. As the horses are clearly the main visual focus it would have been nice to see them filling the screen with head held high and flowing manes rather than in the background. Good luck though.', '2010-11-01 14:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6206971, 917506, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice looking Heron  :- )<br/> <br/>I think this is a difficult crop to maximise the Heron and I''m not quite sure you have it right - but to be fair I''m not sure what I would have done either . .  but it''s still a nice capture.</td>', 'Nice looking Heron  :- ) I think this is a difficult crop to maximise the Heron and I''m not quite sure you have it right - but to be fair I''m not sure what I would have done either . .  but it''s still a nice capture.', '2010-11-01 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
