(6206987, 917231, 68586, '<td valign="top">I think if you are going to have only one single vertical in a shot it''s probably important to get it vertical . . <br/> <br/>Otherwise a tighter crop and using the rule of thirds this might actually be an interesting shot in it''s own right - but it''s going to be facing some pretty tough opposition</td>', 'I think if you are going to have only one single vertical in a shot it''s probably important to get it vertical . .  Otherwise a tighter crop and using the rule of thirds this might actually be an interesting shot in it''s own right - but it''s going to be facing some pretty tough opposition', '2010-11-01 14:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6206990, 917024, 68586, '<td valign="top">Well it ain''t pigeons . . but I kinda like the shot.<br/> <br/>Good tonal range, nice DoF, good crowd of gulls and a pleasing sky - not to mention the great diagonal.<br/> <br/>Yep - works for me.</td>', 'Well it ain''t pigeons . . but I kinda like the shot. Good tonal range, nice DoF, good crowd of gulls and a pleasing sky - not to mention the great diagonal. Yep - works for me.', '2010-11-01 14:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
