(6206993, 916890, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wow - a Golden Oriole - very uncommon on these shores.<br/> <br/>I actually quite like the starkness of this picture with the grey sky, dead tree trunk and splash of colour on the bird but to actually score well you really needed a lot more bird and a lot less sky. Pity you couldn''t have followed it to where it landed and do a close up  :- )</td>', 'Wow - a Golden Oriole - very uncommon on these shores. I actually quite like the starkness of this picture with the grey sky, dead tree trunk and splash of colour on the bird but to actually score well you really needed a lot more bird and a lot less sky. Pity you couldn''t have followed it to where it landed and do a close up  :- )', '2010-11-01 14:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6206998, 916657, 68586, '<td valign="top">I do have a soft spot for Canada geese.   :- )<br/> <br/>Nice water colour and ripples - if I was being fussy I would probably prefer it to be recropped (if possible) so he was looking into the shot - rather than out of it, but that''s just personal taste</td>', 'I do have a soft spot for Canada geese.   :- ) Nice water colour and ripples - if I was being fussy I would probably prefer it to be recropped (if possible) so he was looking into the shot - rather than out of it, but that''s just personal taste', '2010-11-01 14:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
