(6207404, 917261, 59029, '<td valign="top">Hmm, technically the horses of Assateague and Chincoteague are *only* feral horses - their ancestors were domestic stock.  There really are no truly wild horses left except for Prezwalski''s horse.  But still a good shot! :-)</td>', 'Hmm, technically the horses of Assateague and Chincoteague are *only* feral horses - their ancestors were domestic stock.  There really are no truly wild horses left except for Prezwalski''s horse.  But still a good shot! :-)', '2010-11-01 18:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
