(6208477, 917461, 108069, '<td valign="top">A bit too much vignette going on here for my taste but it''s a captivating photo. Instead of alert though I see sad emotion. Eh, regardless, very nice work.</td>', 'A bit too much vignette going on here for my taste but it''s a captivating photo. Instead of alert though I see sad emotion. Eh, regardless, very nice work.', '2010-11-02 10:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
