(6208480, 917160, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene. Good composition. It could be a bit sharper, and I hope you don''t take this the wrong way, but I think some of the processing pros here could turn this into a ribbon winner. As it is it falls slightly short of the cliche wow level, but all in all well done.</td>', 'Very nice scene. Good composition. It could be a bit sharper, and I hope you don''t take this the wrong way, but I think some of the processing pros here could turn this into a ribbon winner. As it is it falls slightly short of the cliche wow level, but all in all well done.', '2010-11-02 10:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208481, 916766, 108069, '<td valign="top">Hilarious title. Great shot.</td>', 'Hilarious title. Great shot.', '2010-11-02 10:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208490, 916988, 108069, '<td valign="top">Too much vignette action here for my taste, but it''s a great capture.</td>', 'Too much vignette action here for my taste, but it''s a great capture.', '2010-11-02 10:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208504, 917231, 108069, '<td valign="top">Album cover material. Great capture and terrific processing.</td>', 'Album cover material. Great capture and terrific processing.', '2010-11-02 11:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208517, 917067, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lacks sharpness a bit. I also can''t make out what the black object is in the top center of the image. Otherwise it''s a nice capture with really good composition.</td>', 'Lacks sharpness a bit. I also can''t make out what the black object is in the top center of the image. Otherwise it''s a nice capture with really good composition.', '2010-11-02 11:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208526, 917399, 108069, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this took a serious crop and/or a high ISO to capture more light, because as I''m sure you''ve heard, it''s fairly grainy. (The more I look at it I''m guessing certainly crop, as it''s universally not especially sharp). Otherwise it''s a nice scene and well balanced. Colors could be a bit more vivid, although the light tones give it a painting look.<br/> <br/>Not that you care, but what I would have done is applied a decent amount of Gaussian blur, which would have gotten rid of a lot of that grain while enhancing the early morning/dreamy aspect of the scene and the tones.<br/> <br/>But I am not a photographer, I only play one on DPC.</td>', 'I''m guessing this took a serious crop and/or a high ISO to capture more light, because as I''m sure you''ve heard, it''s fairly grainy. (The more I look at it I''m guessing certainly crop, as it''s universally not especially sharp). Otherwise it''s a nice scene and well balanced. Colors could be a bit more vivid, although the light tones give it a painting look. Not that you care, but what I would have done is applied a decent amount of Gaussian blur, which would have gotten rid of a lot of that grain while enhancing the early morning/dreamy aspect of the scene and the tones. But I am not a photographer, I only play one on DPC.', '2010-11-02 11:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208532, 917281, 108069, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice view. The focus seems a bit off, but still a very nice capture.</td>', 'Pretty nice view. The focus seems a bit off, but still a very nice capture.', '2010-11-02 11:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208533, 917404, 108069, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting on your subject. Really jumps out. The reflection emphasizes that, but to be honest I would have cropped much of that water out, only leaving the shoreline. But I don''t vote on what I would have done. Just thinking out loud had I had such a good shot to work with. Great photo.</td>', 'Amazing lighting on your subject. Really jumps out. The reflection emphasizes that, but to be honest I would have cropped much of that water out, only leaving the shoreline. But I don''t vote on what I would have done. Just thinking out loud had I had such a good shot to work with. Great photo.', '2010-11-02 11:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208541, 917319, 108069, '<td valign="top">Well spotted scene, but something''s not right.</td>', 'Well spotted scene, but something''s not right.', '2010-11-02 11:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6208542, 916836, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. Moody scene. Great capture.</td>', 'Excellent composition. Moody scene. Great capture.', '2010-11-02 11:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
