(6210244, 917461, 60495, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how to judge this one because the square catch lights in the eyes makes it look like it may be captive animal which would make it questionable as far as the challenge so I am not going to judge it in case I am wrong. Pretty cool cat though, kind of wish the top of the ears were not cut off but still a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I am not sure how to judge this one because the square catch lights in the eyes makes it look like it may be captive animal which would make it questionable as far as the challenge so I am not going to judge it in case I am wrong. Pretty cool cat though, kind of wish the top of the ears were not cut off but still a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-11-03 12:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
