(6211644, 916794, 16106, '<td valign="top">I love the way you framed this, the way the curve of the neck and the curve of the grass echoes back and forth, the tonal evenness and the crisp focus on the eye and nose. Well done.</td>', 'I love the way you framed this, the way the curve of the neck and the curve of the grass echoes back and forth, the tonal evenness and the crisp focus on the eye and nose. Well done.', '2010-11-04 13:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211645, 917246, 16106, '<td valign="top">The way the blurry orange in the background spotlights this little guy really makes this work, great contrasting colors</td>', 'The way the blurry orange in the background spotlights this little guy really makes this work, great contrasting colors', '2010-11-04 13:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211720, 917419, 65234, '<td valign="top">Imaginative concept.  The scientific community must be all agog at your find.  However, my interpretation of this as being an animal of any sort is purely title-dependent, which for this challenge is not optimal.</td>', 'Imaginative concept.  The scientific community must be all agog at your find.  However, my interpretation of this as being an animal of any sort is purely title-dependent, which for this challenge is not optimal.', '2010-11-04 14:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211722, 917067, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cool birds!  Shot seems just a bit OOF.</td>', 'Very cool birds!  Shot seems just a bit OOF.', '2010-11-04 14:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211750, 917482, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute and fuzzy :-)  Adorable baby looking like it''s trying very hard to make itself small and unnoticeable.</td>', 'Cute and fuzzy :-)  Adorable baby looking like it''s trying very hard to make itself small and unnoticeable.', '2010-11-04 15:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211762, 916986, 27662, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous - I love this in the black and white!</td>', 'Gorgeous - I love this in the black and white!', '2010-11-04 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211869, 917186, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice environmental shot.  I usually prefer a tighter crop but the outlines of those trees in the background are quite nice (and African Plain-looking).  Definitely adds to the scene for me.</td>', 'Very nice environmental shot.  I usually prefer a tighter crop but the outlines of those trees in the background are quite nice (and African Plain-looking).  Definitely adds to the scene for me.', '2010-11-04 16:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211884, 917246, 101702, '<td valign="top">"For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment."<br/> <br/>Nice bug shot, but as per the above it doesn''t include insects. Therefore I''m saying this does not meet the challenge. Sorry.</td>', '"For the purpose of this challenge, "wildlife" should be considered non-domesticated mammals, birds, reptiles and amphibians living in a natural environment." Nice bug shot, but as per the above it doesn''t include insects. Therefore I''m saying this does not meet the challenge. Sorry.', '2010-11-04 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211890, 917477, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed.</td>', 'Nicely framed.', '2010-11-04 16:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211892, 916911, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and eye contact.</td>', 'Nice pose and eye contact.', '2010-11-04 16:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211893, 916794, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice pose and light.</td>', 'Very nice pose and light.', '2010-11-04 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211894, 917261, 65234, '<td valign="top">Some day I have to go visit those ponies.  Looks nicely bug-free this time of year :-)</td>', 'Some day I have to go visit those ponies.  Looks nicely bug-free this time of year :-)', '2010-11-04 16:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211896, 917235, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute little deer :-)  Like the soft, rich feel to this.</td>', 'Very cute little deer :-)  Like the soft, rich feel to this.', '2010-11-04 16:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211899, 917437, 65234, '<td valign="top">What adorably cheery little birds!  Green bokeh is a nice background for them.</td>', 'What adorably cheery little birds!  Green bokeh is a nice background for them.', '2010-11-04 16:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211901, 916407, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute little spiky critter.</td>', 'Cute little spiky critter.', '2010-11-04 16:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211902, 917071, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light; lots of tension in their poses, as there should be.  Great find for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice light; lots of tension in their poses, as there should be.  Great find for this challenge.', '2010-11-04 16:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211906, 917226, 65234, '<td valign="top">Look at those taut muscles!  Powerful cat.</td>', 'Look at those taut muscles!  Powerful cat.', '2010-11-04 16:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211908, 917413, 65234, '<td valign="top">For some reason he looks like he''s frowning.  Great capture, though I wish it didn''t look so much like he was about to get bopped on the head by that big stick.</td>', 'For some reason he looks like he''s frowning.  Great capture, though I wish it didn''t look so much like he was about to get bopped on the head by that big stick.', '2010-11-04 16:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211909, 917335, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute; and he does have a rather unusual reflection in his eye.</td>', 'Cute; and he does have a rather unusual reflection in his eye.', '2010-11-04 16:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211913, 917506, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light.  Eye is very sharp; feathers look a bit like they''ve had noise reduction done.</td>', 'Nice light.  Eye is very sharp; feathers look a bit like they''ve had noise reduction done.', '2010-11-04 16:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211919, 917390, 65234, '<td valign="top">Tough capture.  Could use a bit of dodging and burning to bring out the eye more, I think.</td>', 'Tough capture.  Could use a bit of dodging and burning to bring out the eye more, I think.', '2010-11-04 16:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211922, 917281, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great pose.  Just that bit of what looks like camera shake that keeps this from being an outstanding capture.</td>', 'Great pose.  Just that bit of what looks like camera shake that keeps this from being an outstanding capture.', '2010-11-04 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211924, 917254, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like the sort of weather only ducks really like.</td>', 'Looks like the sort of weather only ducks really like.', '2010-11-04 16:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211926, 917101, 65234, '<td valign="top">He looks a little unsure about his position.  Nice and sharp, but colors look a little washed out on my screen.</td>', 'He looks a little unsure about his position.  Nice and sharp, but colors look a little washed out on my screen.', '2010-11-04 16:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211928, 916735, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute little fluffy things!  I think I''d crop out most of the foreground as it''s mostly OOF and doesn''t add much to the image.</td>', 'Cute little fluffy things!  I think I''d crop out most of the foreground as it''s mostly OOF and doesn''t add much to the image.', '2010-11-04 16:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211934, 916532, 65234, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of an oriental woodcut for some reason.  The Kite looks quite interesting; I feel like I want a tighter crop so I can see it better.  Not sure what I think of what appears to be an overlay, though the color is great as a background for the Kite.</td>', 'Reminds me of an oriental woodcut for some reason.  The Kite looks quite interesting; I feel like I want a tighter crop so I can see it better.  Not sure what I think of what appears to be an overlay, though the color is great as a background for the Kite.', '2010-11-04 16:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211938, 917469, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great bird in an unusual pose perched on that railing.  Looks slightly OOF to me, though.</td>', 'Great bird in an unusual pose perched on that railing.  Looks slightly OOF to me, though.', '2010-11-04 16:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211945, 917084, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird!!  Kind of want the feeder pole excluded from the shot; maybe a tighter crop?</td>', 'Beautiful bird!!  Kind of want the feeder pole excluded from the shot; maybe a tighter crop?', '2010-11-04 16:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211951, 917118, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love all the activity and I see a catchlight in the eye, but overall focus seems off.</td>', 'Love all the activity and I see a catchlight in the eye, but overall focus seems off.', '2010-11-04 16:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211952, 916974, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute perspective; nice to see a squirrel NOT in the process of raiding a bird feeder ;-)</td>', 'Cute perspective; nice to see a squirrel NOT in the process of raiding a bird feeder ;-)', '2010-11-04 16:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211954, 916988, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite a long tongue she has!  Setting looks rather zoo-like, which is not optimal for this challenge.</td>', 'Quite a long tongue she has!  Setting looks rather zoo-like, which is not optimal for this challenge.', '2010-11-04 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211958, 917160, 65234, '<td valign="top">That song takes me back a few years ;-)  Very sturdy looking horses.</td>', 'That song takes me back a few years ;-)  Very sturdy looking horses.', '2010-11-04 16:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211959, 917089, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp little eye.  Feathers are looking like they''ve had noise reduction.</td>', 'Nice sharp little eye.  Feathers are looking like they''ve had noise reduction.', '2010-11-04 17:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211960, 917473, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the catchlight in her eye.  Detail looks best amongst the leaves below her.  She looks a bit plastic to me.</td>', 'Like the catchlight in her eye.  Detail looks best amongst the leaves below her.  She looks a bit plastic to me.', '2010-11-04 17:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211962, 917181, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like all the water beads.  Eye could use a bit of dodging, IMO; it''s very hard to see any expression there.</td>', 'Like all the water beads.  Eye could use a bit of dodging, IMO; it''s very hard to see any expression there.', '2010-11-04 17:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211966, 916294, 65234, '<td valign="top">It''s cute when they do that ;-)  I was thinking I might want more DOF to get the head in focus, but maybe not.  The wing and legs are interesting as is.</td>', 'It''s cute when they do that ;-)  I was thinking I might want more DOF to get the head in focus, but maybe not.  The wing and legs are interesting as is.', '2010-11-04 17:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211968, 917021, 65234, '<td valign="top">A Beaver?!  Those are tough to find, let alone photograph.  Personally, I think I''d like to see much deeper colors in those reflections, though I suppose the Beaver would then be less obvious.</td>', 'A Beaver?!  Those are tough to find, let alone photograph.  Personally, I think I''d like to see much deeper colors in those reflections, though I suppose the Beaver would then be less obvious.', '2010-11-04 17:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211969, 916647, 65234, '<td valign="top">That doesn''t look comfortable, yet he looks relaxed.  Smiling, even.  Image looks just a little soft to me.</td>', 'That doesn''t look comfortable, yet he looks relaxed.  Smiling, even.  Image looks just a little soft to me.', '2010-11-04 17:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211970, 917404, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light here.</td>', 'Nice light here.', '2010-11-04 17:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211973, 917505, 51208, '<td valign="top">Wow</td>', 'Wow', '2010-11-04 17:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211975, 917147, 65234, '<td valign="top">Kind of dreamy for a fellow with that many points on his antlers.  Might like a bit tighter crop bottom and left to get rid of that blob on the lower left.</td>', 'Kind of dreamy for a fellow with that many points on his antlers.  Might like a bit tighter crop bottom and left to get rid of that blob on the lower left.', '2010-11-04 17:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211980, 917230, 65234, '<td valign="top">Impressively close.  Looks to me like it could use a contrast boost.</td>', 'Impressively close.  Looks to me like it could use a contrast boost.', '2010-11-04 17:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211984, 917071, 10523, '<td valign="top">should be a ribbon- great shot</td>', 'should be a ribbon- great shot', '2010-11-04 17:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211986, 917015, 10523, '<td valign="top">should be a ribbon- great shot</td>', 'should be a ribbon- great shot', '2010-11-04 17:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211987, 917186, 10523, '<td valign="top">nice shot- top 5</td>', 'nice shot- top 5', '2010-11-04 17:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211989, 916407, 10523, '<td valign="top">nice shot- top 5</td>', 'nice shot- top 5', '2010-11-04 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211991, 917080, 10523, '<td valign="top">nice shot- top 5</td>', 'nice shot- top 5', '2010-11-04 17:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211992, 916836, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the minimalism, though I think there''s a bit more shadow on the Gull than is optimal for appreciating him.</td>', 'Like the minimalism, though I think there''s a bit more shadow on the Gull than is optimal for appreciating him.', '2010-11-04 17:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211993, 916569, 65234, '<td valign="top">Rather in-your-face little guy!</td>', 'Rather in-your-face little guy!', '2010-11-04 17:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211995, 917370, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lighting certainly helps create an illusion of majesty ;-)  Maybe could use a touch more sharpness/contrast.</td>', 'Lighting certainly helps create an illusion of majesty ;-)  Maybe could use a touch more sharpness/contrast.', '2010-11-04 17:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6211999, 916313, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and idea, but want just a bit more pigeon.  If the jagged crack wasn''t running behind him I might not react the same way, but as it is he''s just not a strong enough suggestion of a bird for me.</td>', 'Like the composition and idea, but want just a bit more pigeon.  If the jagged crack wasn''t running behind him I might not react the same way, but as it is he''s just not a strong enough suggestion of a bird for me.', '2010-11-04 17:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212002, 917504, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice pastels, and I like some blurry birds in motion shots, but this one isn''t quite working for me.</td>', 'Nice pastels, and I like some blurry birds in motion shots, but this one isn''t quite working for me.', '2010-11-04 17:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212004, 917162, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and I love that the berry in his mouth looks to be in mid bounce ;-)</td>', 'Nice colors and I love that the berry in his mouth looks to be in mid bounce ;-)', '2010-11-04 17:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212008, 916460, 65234, '<td valign="top">The Holy Grail of Woodpeckers!  I always feel lucky when I spot one of these guys.  Definitely would have cropped this shot tighter to get rid of most of the OOF foreground.</td>', 'The Holy Grail of Woodpeckers!  I always feel lucky when I spot one of these guys.  Definitely would have cropped this shot tighter to get rid of most of the OOF foreground.', '2010-11-04 17:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212010, 917287, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light!</td>', 'Nice light!', '2010-11-04 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212012, 917231, 65234, '<td valign="top">Kind of want to see the fog better, I think.</td>', 'Kind of want to see the fog better, I think.', '2010-11-04 17:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212013, 916959, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome to see elephants in the wild :-)  Might have cropped quite a bit tighter on top so we could see the critters better.</td>', 'Awesome to see elephants in the wild :-)  Might have cropped quite a bit tighter on top so we could see the critters better.', '2010-11-04 17:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212018, 916636, 65234, '<td valign="top">Light does work as camouflage, but I''m not finding any wildlife except on the poster.  Could be I just haven''t spotted it.  I don''t generally consider people to be "non-domesticated mammals."</td>', 'Light does work as camouflage, but I''m not finding any wildlife except on the poster.  Could be I just haven''t spotted it.  I don''t generally consider people to be "non-domesticated mammals."', '2010-11-04 17:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212019, 916826, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely dramatic sky.</td>', 'Nicely dramatic sky.', '2010-11-04 17:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212020, 917270, 65234, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look as ugly as many buzzards ;-)  Colors look washed out on my screen.</td>', 'Doesn''t look as ugly as many buzzards ;-)  Colors look washed out on my screen.', '2010-11-04 17:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212022, 917174, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute pose; I''d like to see the whole head in focus, I think.</td>', 'Cute pose; I''d like to see the whole head in focus, I think.', '2010-11-04 17:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212024, 916607, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the colors but want a bit more definition on the bird.  At least, I assume it''s a bird.  It looks a bit like a tissue caught in a breeze to me.</td>', 'Like the colors but want a bit more definition on the bird.  At least, I assume it''s a bird.  It looks a bit like a tissue caught in a breeze to me.', '2010-11-04 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212047, 917437, 97559, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity for the birds in the foreground.  Lovely bokeh.   Could you have put water droplets on the feeding tins?</td>', 'Excellent clarity for the birds in the foreground.  Lovely bokeh.   Could you have put water droplets on the feeding tins?', '2010-11-04 18:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212079, 916647, 97225, '<td valign="top">Roflmao coz it looks like that''s what he''s doing. It''s a great shot of the seal and the background is wonderful.</td>', 'Roflmao coz it looks like that''s what he''s doing. It''s a great shot of the seal and the background is wonderful.', '2010-11-04 18:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212080, 916645, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and tones. Title is truly inspired and, like it or not, helps the photo. Great focal depth. Wonderful.</td>', 'Excellent colors and tones. Title is truly inspired and, like it or not, helps the photo. Great focal depth. Wonderful.', '2010-11-04 18:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212081, 916579, 108069, '<td valign="top">Outstanding focal depth. Nice pose as well. Rich colors, razor sharp. Very well done.</td>', 'Outstanding focal depth. Nice pose as well. Rich colors, razor sharp. Very well done.', '2010-11-04 18:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212082, 917404, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully serene. I love how the bird is enhanced by the dark background.</td>', 'Beautifully serene. I love how the bird is enhanced by the dark background.', '2010-11-04 18:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212083, 917390, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great (and brave) capture.</td>', 'Great (and brave) capture.', '2010-11-04 18:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212084, 916683, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Would like a bit more local contrast, but the scene is too good to not get rewarded.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Would like a bit more local contrast, but the scene is too good to not get rewarded.', '2010-11-04 18:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212095, 917280, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I love how she appears to be eyeballing the viewer. She must have had you in her sights!</td>', 'Great capture. I love how she appears to be eyeballing the viewer. She must have had you in her sights!', '2010-11-04 19:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212096, 916992, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.</td>', 'Beautiful image.', '2010-11-04 19:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212304, 917119, 117534, '<td valign="top">Stunning!!! I predict if not the Blue this will ribbon!!!</td>', 'Stunning!!! I predict if not the Blue this will ribbon!!!', '2010-11-04 22:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212305, 917015, 117534, '<td valign="top">WOW just WOW what a Awesome capture!!!</td>', 'WOW just WOW what a Awesome capture!!!', '2010-11-04 22:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212388, 917015, 97225, '<td valign="top">Superb positioning, and excellent detail.</td>', 'Superb positioning, and excellent detail.', '2010-11-05 00:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212389, 916636, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pattern of shadows.</td>', 'Wonderful pattern of shadows.', '2010-11-05 00:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212390, 916816, 97225, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. She looks a little sad.</td>', 'Excellent capture. She looks a little sad.', '2010-11-05 00:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212393, 917101, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured. It looks like it is getting a little extra support.</td>', 'Beautifully captured. It looks like it is getting a little extra support.', '2010-11-05 00:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212395, 917272, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. Those wing feathers are nicely displayed.</td>', 'Beautiful capture. Those wing feathers are nicely displayed.', '2010-11-05 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212397, 917235, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fairytale pretty!</td>', 'Fairytale pretty!', '2010-11-05 00:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212398, 917456, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured.</td>', 'Beautifully captured.', '2010-11-05 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212400, 916645, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured. I love the surrounding colours which are even reflected onto the white coat. 9</td>', 'Beautifully captured. I love the surrounding colours which are even reflected onto the white coat. 9', '2010-11-05 00:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212401, 917071, 97225, '<td valign="top">Well captured. It can''t be easy to get this kind of action.</td>', 'Well captured. It can''t be easy to get this kind of action.', '2010-11-05 00:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212402, 917461, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2010-11-05 00:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212403, 916926, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great capture - of the bird itself and of the magnificent background.</td>', 'Great capture - of the bird itself and of the magnificent background.', '2010-11-05 00:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212404, 916704, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but with the fence and the headstalls it doesn''t really say wildlife.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but with the fence and the headstalls it doesn''t really say wildlife.', '2010-11-05 00:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212407, 916569, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2010-11-05 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212409, 917287, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird, and beautiful image. I love the contrast between subject and environment.</td>', 'Beautiful bird, and beautiful image. I love the contrast between subject and environment.', '2010-11-05 00:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212413, 917474, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.', '2010-11-05 00:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212416, 917417, 97225, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. (Brave you!)</td>', 'Excellent capture. (Brave you!)', '2010-11-05 00:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212418, 916407, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured. Any time I''ve tried to shoot one of these it has either been all tucked in or had its back towards me.</td>', 'Nicely captured. Any time I''ve tried to shoot one of these it has either been all tucked in or had its back towards me.', '2010-11-05 00:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212419, 916406, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured.</td>', 'Beautifully captured.', '2010-11-05 00:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212420, 916956, 97225, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully captured.</td>', 'Very beautifully captured.', '2010-11-05 00:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212421, 916683, 97225, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.</td>', 'Excellent capture.', '2010-11-05 00:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212422, 917370, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and well captured.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and well captured.', '2010-11-05 00:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212423, 917119, 97225, '<td valign="top">Excellent wild life portrait.</td>', 'Excellent wild life portrait.', '2010-11-05 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212449, 917505, 114285, '<td valign="top">The perfect picture. 10</td>', 'The perfect picture. 10', '2010-11-05 01:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
