(6212933, 916657, 103142, '<td valign="top">This is truly lovely! People don''t take many pictures of canada geese, because they see them so often. I forget how lovely the are. Nice capture! (not voting in this challenge.)</td>', 'This is truly lovely! People don''t take many pictures of canada geese, because they see them so often. I forget how lovely the are. Nice capture! (not voting in this challenge.)', '2010-11-05 13:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212950, 917172, 103142, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful! Striking! (not voting in this challenge.)<br/> <br/>Ok. So I have a very happy score going in this challenge -- so I thought I''d have some fun and guess which photos were going to be my greatest competition. There are 6 photos that worry me greatly. And this is one! The lighting is so beautiful on this. Wonderful capture! I''m not voting in this competition, but this would have been a 9. Good luck!!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful! Striking! (not voting in this challenge.) Ok. So I have a very happy score going in this challenge -- so I thought I''d have some fun and guess which photos were going to be my greatest competition. There are 6 photos that worry me greatly. And this is one! The lighting is so beautiful on this. Wonderful capture! I''m not voting in this competition, but this would have been a 9. Good luck!!', '2010-11-05 13:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6212951, 917067, 103142, '<td valign="top">Does that nest really belong to them? It''s so incredibly tiny! What bizarre looking birds! (nice capture, btw) (not voting in this challenge.)</td>', 'Does that nest really belong to them? It''s so incredibly tiny! What bizarre looking birds! (nice capture, btw) (not voting in this challenge.)', '2010-11-05 13:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
