(6213694, 916826, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Wonderful mood, excellent tones, sharp, clear contrast. Excellent.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Wonderful mood, excellent tones, sharp, clear contrast. Excellent.', '2010-11-06 11:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213695, 916890, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. Lovely color and contrast against a stark sky. Sharp. Wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful capture. Lovely color and contrast against a stark sky. Sharp. Wonderful.', '2010-11-06 11:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213696, 917147, 108069, '<td valign="top">Magnificent. Excellent focus on the subject; moody, well composed photo. Very well done.</td>', 'Magnificent. Excellent focus on the subject; moody, well composed photo. Very well done.', '2010-11-06 11:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213697, 917235, 108069, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene, but... to be honest it looks like an exhibit. If not this is an incredible capture. Not voting on this one.<br/> <br/>Have changed my mind and will vote, as upon closer inspection it certainly appears to be the real deal. Excellent depth of field, great framing with the trees. Sharp, yet soft enough to convey the hazy morning feeling. Extremely well done.</td>', 'Lovely scene, but... to be honest it looks like an exhibit. If not this is an incredible capture. Not voting on this one. Have changed my mind and will vote, as upon closer inspection it certainly appears to be the real deal. Excellent depth of field, great framing with the trees. Sharp, yet soft enough to convey the hazy morning feeling. Extremely well done.', '2010-11-06 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213698, 917419, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I love everything about it.</td>', 'Awesome. I love everything about it.', '2010-11-06 11:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213699, 917015, 108069, '<td valign="top">What are they herring?<br/> <br/>Man that was bad. Lack of sleep. Excellent shot. Composition is truly great, lovely tones, and excellent detail in the feathers. Perfectly exposed as well. Nice job.</td>', 'What are they herring? Man that was bad. Lack of sleep. Excellent shot. Composition is truly great, lovely tones, and excellent detail in the feathers. Perfectly exposed as well. Nice job.', '2010-11-06 11:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213700, 917370, 108069, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Truly perfect composition, lovely tones and excellent detail. And of course a great captured moment. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful. Truly perfect composition, lovely tones and excellent detail. And of course a great captured moment. Well done.', '2010-11-06 11:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213701, 916313, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Love the flutter of motion contrasted against the rigid framing of the lines. Nice one.</td>', 'Very cool shot. Love the flutter of motion contrasted against the rigid framing of the lines. Nice one.', '2010-11-06 11:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213702, 917437, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice depth of field. Great color and extremely sharp right where it needs to be. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice depth of field. Great color and extremely sharp right where it needs to be. Well done.', '2010-11-06 11:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213703, 917347, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great shot. They appear to be posing, or at least not that into it, as they don''t have aggressive stances. Considering this is as close as I''ve ever gotten to one, let alone two, maybe I''ve got it all wrong. Wonderful focal depth, sharp where it needs it. Excellent work.</td>', 'Great shot. They appear to be posing, or at least not that into it, as they don''t have aggressive stances. Considering this is as close as I''ve ever gotten to one, let alone two, maybe I''ve got it all wrong. Wonderful focal depth, sharp where it needs it. Excellent work.', '2010-11-06 11:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213704, 917287, 108069, '<td valign="top">What is he plotting? Excellent processing. Well spotted scene. Nice work.</td>', 'What is he plotting? Excellent processing. Well spotted scene. Nice work.', '2010-11-06 11:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213705, 917024, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Excellent choice for B&amp;W. Nice tonal range. Very well spotted scene. Well done.</td>', 'Great photo. Excellent choice for B&W. Nice tonal range. Very well spotted scene. Well done.', '2010-11-06 11:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213707, 917417, 108069, '<td valign="top">Super sharp, nice composition, clever (though perfectly descriptive) title, and great excellent colors. Well done.</td>', 'Super sharp, nice composition, clever (though perfectly descriptive) title, and great excellent colors. Well done.', '2010-11-06 11:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213712, 917477, 67258, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous; beautifully composed, tack sharp where it needs to be, and good exposure.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous; beautifully composed, tack sharp where it needs to be, and good exposure.', '2010-11-06 11:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213714, 917280, 67258, '<td valign="top">A super portrait, but I would have liked to see more of the environment to help provide some context.</td>', 'A super portrait, but I would have liked to see more of the environment to help provide some context.', '2010-11-06 11:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213716, 916532, 67258, '<td valign="top">Red Kites are absolutely magnificent birds, and we see them from time to time in Yorkshire - never managed to get a photo though.  Technically, the bird is lovely and sharp, but the photo is let down a little by the ring bokeh produced by your lens, and the sensor dust.  Good composition that suits the title.  I would have been delighted to capture this photo.</td>', 'Red Kites are absolutely magnificent birds, and we see them from time to time in Yorkshire - never managed to get a photo though.  Technically, the bird is lovely and sharp, but the photo is let down a little by the ring bokeh produced by your lens, and the sensor dust.  Good composition that suits the title.  I would have been delighted to capture this photo.', '2010-11-06 11:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6213717, 916956, 67258, '<td valign="top">A lovely composition, and good exposure, but there seems to be something odd going on with the texture - too much noise reduction, perhaps?</td>', 'A lovely composition, and good exposure, but there seems to be something odd going on with the texture - too much noise reduction, perhaps?', '2010-11-06 11:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
