(6214895, 917051, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Wonderful contrast of the tack sharp gull against the out of focus ripples on the water.  I''ve tried enough times to photograph them to know how hard they are to capture, and I love this moment in their flight sequence.</td>', 'Lovely. Wonderful contrast of the tack sharp gull against the out of focus ripples on the water.  I''ve tried enough times to photograph them to know how hard they are to capture, and I love this moment in their flight sequence.', '2010-11-07 13:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6214904, 917235, 122896, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo with such clarity. I like the faded tree at the background. It makes the photo look a bit surreal...as if it was a painting in a fairy book. 10</td>', 'Beautiful photo with such clarity. I like the faded tree at the background. It makes the photo look a bit surreal...as if it was a painting in a fairy book. 10', '2010-11-07 14:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
