(6215089, 917108, 2158, '<td valign="top">I know photos of toys often struggle in challenges here, but I think you''ve done a great job.</td>', 'I know photos of toys often struggle in challenges here, but I think you''ve done a great job.', '2010-11-07 17:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215154, 917505, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! An amazing shot! I know how hard it is to freeze a humming bird''s wings - haven''t managed it yet. Perfect stop action and I can''t imagine how you got the humming bird to face you! The bokeh is pleasing and the colors are fabulous. My pick for blue. Even in a free study this shot would do very well. Not a fan of the border though.</td>', 'Wow! An amazing shot! I know how hard it is to freeze a humming bird''s wings - haven''t managed it yet. Perfect stop action and I can''t imagine how you got the humming bird to face you! The bokeh is pleasing and the colors are fabulous. My pick for blue. Even in a free study this shot would do very well. Not a fan of the border though.', '2010-11-07 18:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215166, 917119, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very neat! The eyes give it a scared or surprised look. The bokeh serves well to keep the stag in limelight, and the light itself is nice, warm and pleasing. The crop has a good balance to it too. My top 10.</td>', 'Very neat! The eyes give it a scared or surprised look. The bokeh serves well to keep the stag in limelight, and the light itself is nice, warm and pleasing. The crop has a good balance to it too. My top 10.', '2010-11-07 18:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215174, 917080, 59796, '<td valign="top">Apt title! Good detail on the whites and the picture is sharp. I would''ve preferred some more negative space on the right and bottom so that the bird looks at a point inside the picture. My top 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'Apt title! Good detail on the whites and the picture is sharp. I would''ve preferred some more negative space on the right and bottom so that the bird looks at a point inside the picture. My top 10 for this challenge.', '2010-11-07 18:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215179, 916407, 59796, '<td valign="top">Cute little Echidna. The lighting is soft and pleasing. I would''ve preferred either a slightly tighter crop on the right (putting the eye at 2/3rds) or more negative space on the right and bottom to give it room to go. My top 10.</td>', 'Cute little Echidna. The lighting is soft and pleasing. I would''ve preferred either a slightly tighter crop on the right (putting the eye at 2/3rds) or more negative space on the right and bottom to give it room to go. My top 10.', '2010-11-07 18:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6215181, 916406, 59796, '<td valign="top">Cute little fella. Don''t quite get the title, but he looks like he''s floating on a magic carpet er.. leaf. Nice lighting and fabulous detail in focus. Hope this ribbons.</td>', 'Cute little fella. Don''t quite get the title, but he looks like he''s floating on a magic carpet er.. leaf. Nice lighting and fabulous detail in focus. Hope this ribbons.', '2010-11-07 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
