(6215186, 917147, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very neat foreground bokeh! Makes the stag stand out in the picture very well. Great lighting, and hope your camera was well protected from the rain :) My top 3 for this challenge.</td>', 'Very neat foreground bokeh! Makes the stag stand out in the picture very well. Great lighting, and hope your camera was well protected from the rain :) My top 3 for this challenge.', '2010-11-07 18:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
