(6216090, 917280, 114233, '<td valign="top">Another strong finish and good score Rian. Well done.<br/>I agree with SaraR that I would love to have seen more of the environment but I think you did a great job given the location.<br/>I love the capture of the old torn ears which reminds you that these cats don''t play around!</td>', 'Another strong finish and good score Rian. Well done.I agree with SaraR that I would love to have seen more of the environment but I think you did a great job given the location.I love the capture of the old torn ears which reminds you that these cats don''t play around!', '2010-11-08 06:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
