(6216116, 917108, 122591, '<td valign="top">Glad some of you liked the picture. I was going for a humorous approach, and it seems at least some of the voters liked that.<br/> <br/>Funny to see how many 1''s I managed to get, presumably due to "DNMC". Makes me wonder how this would have scored in another challenge.<br/> <br/>Thanks for votes and for helpful feedback!</td>', 'Glad some of you liked the picture. I was going for a humorous approach, and it seems at least some of the voters liked that. Funny to see how many 1''s I managed to get, presumably due to "DNMC". Makes me wonder how this would have scored in another challenge. Thanks for votes and for helpful feedback!', '2010-11-08 07:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
