(6216676, 917351, 121082, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments. Yes, here in the Low Country it is not unusual to see several Gators on each water hole.<br/> <br/>The green stuff on his/her back is algae. The color in the Photo is the color of the gator the way the sun hit it. I didnt adjust any of the colors in the photo.</td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments. Yes, here in the Low Country it is not unusual to see several Gators on each water hole. The green stuff on his/her back is algae. The color in the Photo is the color of the gator the way the sun hit it. I didnt adjust any of the colors in the photo.', '2010-11-08 15:08:32.000000', NULL, 0),
