(6217349, 917461, 3746, '<td valign="top">"The zoo asked me to take some photos of their new vampire bats for press releases, but when I arrived the bats weren''t in yet. However this lynx was unusually active, and positioned just right in an environment that''s downright hostile to photography."<br/> <br/>So this wasnt in the wild? Its an amazing capture but you havent really said what this "hostile environment" was.<br/> <br/>Great finish.</td>', '"The zoo asked me to take some photos of their new vampire bats for press releases, but when I arrived the bats weren''t in yet. However this lynx was unusually active, and positioned just right in an environment that''s downright hostile to photography." So this wasnt in the wild? Its an amazing capture but you havent really said what this "hostile environment" was. Great finish.', '2010-11-09 06:17:57.000000', NULL, 0),
