(6217543, 917461, 17203, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Simms:</b></div><hr/><i>Its an amazing capture but you havent really said what this "hostile environment" was.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>I explained it on my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=456770" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">last entry</a>. The enclosure dates back to the early 1900''s (the zoo started with PT Barnum''s circus animals), and is constructed with heavy iron bars on the front and back that are difficult to blur away. There''s another fence 8 or 10 feet in front of the bars, while a roof and the surrounding trees limit the available light. The only area that allows good lighting away from the bars and any artificial structures is confined to just a few square feet, although the catchlights a couple of people mentioned were a natural opening in the trees behind me.</td>', 'Originally posted by Simms:Its an amazing capture but you havent really said what this "hostile environment" was. I explained it on my last entry. The enclosure dates back to the early 1900''s (the zoo started with PT Barnum''s circus animals), and is constructed with heavy iron bars on the front and back that are difficult to blur away. There''s another fence 8 or 10 feet in front of the bars, while a roof and the surrounding trees limit the available light. The only area that allows good lighting away from the bars and any artificial structures is confined to just a few square feet, although the catchlights a couple of people mentioned were a natural opening in the trees behind me.', '2010-11-09 10:59:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6217644, 917461, 68586, '<td valign="top">In itself a superb shot !<br/> <br/>In terms of the challenge - does a zoo shot really  fit the challenge description ? <br/> <br/>But then the winner was also in a ''Wildlife Refuge'' so I guess it is all of a muchness.<br/> <br/>Still a great shot</td>', 'In itself a superb shot ! In terms of the challenge - does a zoo shot really  fit the challenge description ?  But then the winner was also in a ''Wildlife Refuge'' so I guess it is all of a muchness. Still a great shot', '2010-11-09 12:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
