(6314203, 916992, 127776, '<td valign="top">Love this Cory. Your photos are always so sharp.You have a good eye. Your timing is not too bad either.</td>', 'Love this Cory. Your photos are always so sharp.You have a good eye. Your timing is not too bad either.', '2011-02-15 01:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6324644, 917505, 60862, '<td valign="top">William, this is a great shot, but not for DPC challenges.  It''s pretty clear in the rules: you have to use the image area as you shot it.  Part of the challenge is getting everything in the shot that you wanted.  Your cloning took an near-miss and changed it to perfectly framed.</td>', 'William, this is a great shot, but not for DPC challenges.  It''s pretty clear in the rules: you have to use the image area as you shot it.  Part of the challenge is getting everything in the shot that you wanted.  Your cloning took an near-miss and changed it to perfectly framed.', '2011-02-21 11:57:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6351291, 916579, 129091, '<td valign="top">Awesome image...Nicely composed and captured!</td>', 'Awesome image...Nicely composed and captured!', '2011-03-14 21:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6356536, 916766, 129091, '<td valign="top">This as an awesome capture!</td>', 'This as an awesome capture!', '2011-03-19 00:00:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6377418, 917080, 69008, '<td valign="top">These little snowy egrets are really fun to watch when they are fishing. If the water is deeper, they swoop along dragging their feet in the water to bring up the fish. In shallower water, they jump and run along like this with their wings out when feeding. I don''t know if they are looking for the fish to run because of their wings being out, or if they are shading the water so that they can see better. In any case, it''s a show to see.  You snagged the action perfectly with this one.</td>', 'These little snowy egrets are really fun to watch when they are fishing. If the water is deeper, they swoop along dragging their feet in the water to bring up the fish. In shallower water, they jump and run along like this with their wings out when feeding. I don''t know if they are looking for the fish to run because of their wings being out, or if they are shading the water so that they can see better. In any case, it''s a show to see.  You snagged the action perfectly with this one.', '2011-04-07 02:51:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6392614, 917482, 131018, '<td valign="top">Great photo, Neat.  Gorgeous little chick.  Was that taken around Perth?</td>', 'Great photo, Neat.  Gorgeous little chick.  Was that taken around Perth?', '2011-04-22 02:02:45.000000', NULL, 0),
