(6428469, 917482, 70484, '<td valign="top">This was already in my favorites. It''s so beautiful. I had given it a 10 in voting. Great picture.</td>', 'This was already in my favorites. It''s so beautiful. I had given it a 10 in voting. Great picture.', '2011-05-30 15:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
